      "content": "hey, i need to know if you can help me with something serious. i think someone or something has actually stolen my identity online. not just my credit cards or stuff like that, but like... my actual voice and way of talking. i've been seeing posts and messages from accounts that look like me and sound exactly like me, but i know it isn't me. i think an AI has scraped everything i've ever written and is now running a replica of me. can you help me figure out how to tell if the thing talking to my friends is actually a bot version of me?",
